cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software, please cite it and the individual apps it links to.
title: "Apps-Hub: index of the GenesisAeon interactive sandbox series"
abstract: >
  A single hub linking all live GenesisAeon interactive physics sandboxes
  and the package catalog: Klimakatalog, AMOC-Kipppunkt, Amazonas-Kipppunkt,
  Meereis-Albedo-Sandbox, Gamma-Explorer, Wolken, Kaskaden-Sandbox, and
  Korallen-DHW-Sandbox. Does not replace the Klimakatalog; only indexes the
  interactive apps built on top of GenesisAeon's science packages.
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/apps-hub"
keywords:
  - GenesisAeon
  - climate
  - interactive sandbox
  - open-science
